<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 02-MAR.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 02-MAR.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Lisette, with 70 mph winds, is near 18.5s/35.4e or moving inland over central Mozambique. High winds and heavy rains will continue to batter the region causing flooding and mudslides. Widespread property damage is expected. This system will rapidly weaken and dissipate by 24 hours. The threat to shipping in the Mozambique Channel is diminishing.</p>
</text>
